'''Eternal III''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was released on June 9th, 2019 to promote [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2’s]] merch. It was originally obtainable by purchasing merch from [https://shopmm2.com shopmm2.com]<ref>https://twitter.com/NikilisRBX/status/1137896369639763979</ref> and redeeming the promotional code that came with it. It is now only obtainable through trading as the merch has since sold out.

==Appearance==
It has a long, slightly jagged cracked green blade with a scratched silver edge. The guard is silver with a green tinge with curved quillons, two sets of horns by the ricasso, and glowing green eyes. The handle, attached to a silver prong below the guard, is silver with a green tinted silver paracord wrap that has glowing green beads on it.

== Trivia== 
*It has two predecessors which were obtained in a similar way, those being [[Eternal]] and [[Eternal II]]. It also has two following successors, those being [[Eternalcane]] and [[Eternal IV]].
*It has been a major target in duping.
*Like all the other Eternal knives, its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/532254782/Sword-of-the-Eternal-Abyss Sword of the Eternal Abyss].

